		<title>Madonna's World Tour 2012</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-world-tour-2012.html"/>
		<published>2011-09-08T01:27:43Z</published>
		<updated>2011-09-08T01:27:43Z</updated>
		<id>http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-world-tour-2012.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first news we have got about &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's next world tour&lt;/strong&gt; are included in the details of &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s collaboration with &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff Nightlife Project&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The tour is planned for &lt;strong&gt;2012&lt;/strong&gt; with rehearsals expected to start in the first quarter of &lt;strong&gt;2012&lt;/strong&gt;, probably in March. Dancers must have at least twelve months validity on their passport from March 2012.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Countries/continents which may be included in &lt;strong&gt;Madonna world tour 2012&lt;/strong&gt; are &lt;strong&gt;USA&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;South America&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Canada&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Europe&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Australia&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;New Zealand&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;catItemIntroText&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UPDATE (7 October, 2011): According to always accurate and reliable Italian newspaper &lt;strong&gt;La  Repubblica&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; will perform in  &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt; on &lt;strong&gt;June 14, 2012&lt;/strong&gt;. Reportedly, the concert is taking   place at &lt;strong&gt;Milan's San Siro Stadium&lt;/strong&gt;. The stadium has been  already booked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UPDATE (9 November, 2011): &lt;a href=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/220-madonna-tour-2012-official-european-dates-revealed.html&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt; to read the first &lt;strong&gt;European dates&lt;/strong&gt; that are confirmed at the moment. The concert in &lt;strong&gt;Milan&lt;/strong&gt; on June 14 is one of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UPDATE (12 November, 2011): Dancer &lt;strong&gt;Lil' Buck&lt;/strong&gt; is the winner of the &lt;strong&gt;Dance4Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; contest in collaboration with &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff&lt;/strong&gt;., which took place at Roseland Ballroom in New York City on November 12. He will be touring with &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UPDATE (22 November, 2011): DrownedMadonna.com heard that &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; will launch her new tour in &lt;strong&gt;Tel Aviv&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Israel&lt;/strong&gt;, on &lt;strong&gt;May 31th&lt;/strong&gt;, 2012. &lt;a href=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/263-madonna-to-launch-her-2012-tour-in-israel.html&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot;&gt;Read more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/dance-auditions-for-madonna-next-tour-in-collaboration-with-smirnoff.html&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; title=&quot;Dance auditions for Madonna World Tour 2012&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt; and read details on dance auditions.&lt;/p&gt;
