		<title>More details on the Dancers Auditions in New York City for Madonna's New Tour</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/52-more-details-on-the-dancers-auditions-in-new-york-city-for-madonnas-new-tour.html"/>
		<published>2011-09-07T13:36:04Z</published>
		<updated>2011-09-07T13:36:04Z</updated>
		<id>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/52-more-details-on-the-dancers-auditions-in-new-york-city-for-madonnas-new-tour.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Giampiero Fiorelli</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff&lt;/strong&gt; just gave us more details regarding the dancers auditions on &lt;strong&gt;September 8&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;New York City&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;Madonna's new tour&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This casting call is for &lt;strong&gt;New York&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Connecticut&lt;/strong&gt; residents only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One dancer from this audition will be chosen by &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s choreographers &lt;strong&gt;Rich and Tone Talauega&lt;/strong&gt; to attend the &lt;strong&gt;November 12&lt;/strong&gt; dance event. The &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff - Madonna Nightlife Exchange&lt;/strong&gt; final event will take place in &lt;strong&gt;New York&lt;/strong&gt; as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come dressed to dance. You must not wear clothing with visible logos/brands. Please bring proper identification showing current address. All auditons may be filmed for use in future promotional content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/img/2011/madonna-tour-dancer-auditions-nyc.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Madonna tour dancers auditions NYC&quot; width=&quot;790&quot; height=&quot;602&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedTags&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smirnoff&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rich &amp; Tone Talauega&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
